From 0e5957e19541e61e9c2e401c4ca0e9b3c1323f2e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Travis Fiorito <travis@sandstorm.chat>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 19:40:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(octo): read isExternal and keep Octo previews out of
 downloads and playlists

Octo marks songs it does not own yet (YouTube previews) with isExternal. The app ignored it, so
previews were downloaded by the keep-downloaded sync and could be added to server playlists.
Now: parsed into ProviderSong/StreamingSong (+ catalog cache), never queued for download (manual or
keep-downloaded), refused for playlist adds.
